WEBVTT

00:14:29.829 --> 00:14:33.579
And if you do that long enough
and you do it well enough,

00:14:33.579 --> 00:14:34.871
somebody is going to notice.

00:14:37.162 --> 00:14:41.287
Captain Sharon Pressler could have
chosen to stay in aviation, but

00:14:41.496 --> 00:14:45.996
once the airline industry starts
furloughing now, there's a glut of pilots,

00:14:45.996 --> 00:14:49.954
right. Because everybody kind of tries
to take a step back and go.

00:14:49.996 --> 00:14:53.037
So I'll go back to being an instructor.
Well, guess what?

00:14:53.037 --> 00:14:54.787
Everybody else is trying to go
back to being an instructor,

00:14:55.246 --> 00:14:57.371
and there's just not the demand.

00:14:58.121 --> 00:14:59.412
The more she thought about it,

00:14:59.746 --> 00:15:02.412
the more she started to reframe
the disturbance as